            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Note: This is with follow-mode `q=`, which `{visual}Q` enables automatically.\n\nThe generic answer is: this \"deduplication\" happens when cursors arrive at the same spot. E.g. if you hit `G` (so all cursors arrive at the same place), would you agree that the cursors should be deduplicated?\n\nHowever in this case where you're hitting `j` and the primary cursor didn't actually move, I agree that it doesn't really make sense for the cursors to \"follow\" the `j`.",
